{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "n-summary",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## 导体公式汇总\n\n静电平衡 → 屏蔽 → 电容 → 串并联 → 电场能量",
			"x": 340,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 120
		},
		{
			"id": "n-equilibrium",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**导体静电平衡**\n\n$$\\vec{E}_{\\text{内}} = 0$$\n\n$$E_{\\text{表}} = \\frac{\\sigma}{\\varepsilon_0}$$",
			"x": 30,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 180
		},
		{
			"id": "n-shielding",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**静电屏蔽**\n\n**外屏蔽**：空腔导体$$\\Rightarrow$$腔内$$E=0$$\n\n**内屏蔽**：接地消除对外影响",
			"x": 30,
			"y": 480,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "n-capacitor",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**电容**\n\n$$C = \\frac{Q}{U}$$\n\n平行板：$$C = \\frac{\\varepsilon_0 S}{d}$$\n\n球形：$$C = 4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\frac{R_a R_b}{R_b-R_a}$$",
			"x": 400,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 210
		},
		{
			"id": "n-series-parallel",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**电容器的串并联**\n\n串联：$$\\frac{1}{C_{\\text{eq}}} = \\sum\\frac{1}{C_i}$$\n\n并联：$$C_{\\text{eq}} = \\sum C_i$$",
			"x": 400,
			"y": 480,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 190
		},
		{
			"id": "n-energy",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**电场能量**\n\n$$W = \\frac{1}{2}CU^2 = \\frac{Q^2}{2C}$$\n\n$$w = \\frac{1}{2}\\varepsilon_0 E^2$$",
			"x": 770,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 170
		}
	],
	"edges": [
		{
			"id": "e1",
